        <h2 data-w-id="636b9637-6c33-daeb-a6c1-8c66363fb8f5" style="opacity:0" class="h2-prix lim-800">The questions we're asked about our <span class="gradient-text">plateau scan</span> with <span class="gradient-text">artificial intelligence</span>:</h2>
        <div class="w-layout-grid faq-solutions prix">
          <div id="w-node-_636b9637-6c33-daeb-a6c1-8c66363fb8fb-6643cc90" data-w-id="636b9637-6c33-daeb-a6c1-8c66363fb8fb" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>How does the 2nd-generation IA Scan work?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">The guest sets down their tray: IA Scan recognizes the items in real time and displays the total and the balance on their card. They pay using their card, credit card, or meal voucher card, then receive their receipt via email or as a QR code.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_636b9637-6c33-daeb-a6c1-8c66363fb914-6643cc90" data-w-id="636b9637-6c33-daeb-a6c1-8c66363fb914" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>What happens if the AI makes a mistake?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">The guest submits their order with a single click using the scanner. The operator reviews and confirms it, and the guest receives an updated receipt.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_636b9637-6c33-daeb-a6c1-8c66363fb925-6643cc90" data-w-id="636b9637-6c33-daeb-a6c1-8c66363fb925" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Does the flatbed scanner work without the Internet?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">In the event of a network outage, passes paid for using a badge are saved and processed once the connection is restored (excluding credit card payments and top-ups).<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_636b9637-6c33-daeb-a6c1-8c66363fb930-6643cc90" data-w-id="636b9637-6c33-daeb-a6c1-8c66363fb930" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Should we take photos of the products every day?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Yes, for the daily specials: the team photographs them before service, which takes about 15 to 20 minutes for a restaurant serving 1,000 covers. Items that are the same from one day to the next do not need to be photographed again.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_39fd1c11-db80-4ea1-da26-94e05623d03c-6643cc90" data-w-id="39fd1c11-db80-4ea1-da26-94e05623d03c" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>Does IA Scan replace checkout staff?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">No. The staff freed up from the register are reassigned to customer service, the front desk, or food preparation, and an assisted register remains available for unforeseen circumstances.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="w-node-_25cf7006-5a2e-db1d-376a-88ff1c05b941-6643cc90" data-w-id="25cf7006-5a2e-db1d-376a-88ff1c05b941" class="accordion-wrapper---solutions no-border">
            <div class="accordion-trigger prix">
              <h3 class="accordion-title---solutions"><strong>For which IA Scan facilities is it suitable?</strong></h3>
              <div class="arrow-faq gradient">
                <div class="html-embed-3 gradient w-embed"><svg width="13" height="8" viewBox="0 0 13 8" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <path d="M6.4997 2.8284L1.54996 7.7782L0.135742 6.364L6.4997 0L12.8637 6.364L11.4495 7.7782L6.4997 2.8284Z" fill="currentColor"/>
  </svg></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="height:0PX" class="accordion-content">
              <div class="accordion-text---solutions">Corporate cafeterias, prestigious universities, training centers… There is no minimum number of seats: IA Scan works just as well for 50 guests as it does for 1,000.<br></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
